Z||000003||Monkeyman||10-01-2000||08:52 AM||||My7Fieros--Sir Ogre's name is pronounced just as it looks.  <I>O-grr</I>.  Check out his website and you'll see.  He's a mean and nasty monster that lives in a cave and eats small animals (and a few unsuspecting human "visitors").  Loves the sight of blood (what an eye opener in the mornings--better than coffee).  Terrifies the young and old alike.  Hates company (except at mealtime which, for an ogre, is 24/7).  This should explain his name.  (j/k about the mean and nasty part--don't rip my arms off, Ogre.)||||reg||1
